      "character_book": {
        "name": "示例-MVU-Vue",
        "entries": [
          {
            "id": 0,
            "keys": [],
            "secondary_keys": [],
            "comment": "[initvar]初始变量",
            "content": "{\n  \"场景\": { \"地点\": \"初始场景\", \"阶段\": \"开场\" },\n  \"角色\": { \"心情\": \"平静\", \"信任\": 0 }\n}\n",
            "constant": true,
            "selective": true,
            "enabled": false,
            "insertion_order": 100,
            "position": "before_char",
            "use_regex": false,
            "extensions": {
              "position": 0,
              "depth": 4,
              "role": 0,
              "probability": 100,
              "useProbability": true,
              "exclude_recursion": true,
              "prevent_recursion": true,
              "display_index": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 1,
            "keys": [],
            "secondary_keys": [],
            "comment": "变量列表",
            "content": "<current_state>\n{{get_message_variable::stat_data}}\n</current_state>\n以上是本轮可用的状态。缺失字段视为未知，不自行当作已经初始化。\n",
            "constant": true,
            "selective": true,
            "enabled": true,
            "insertion_order": 101,
            "position": "before_char",
            "use_regex": false,
            "extensions": {
              "position": 4,
              "depth": 0,
              "role": 0,
              "probability": 100,
              "useProbability": true,
              "exclude_recursion": true,
              "prevent_recursion": true,
              "display_index": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 2,
            "keys": [],
            "secondary_keys": [],
            "comment": "[mvu_update]变量更新规则",
            "content": "只在本轮已发生的事件支持变更时更新状态。\n- 场景.地点：双方实际到达新的地点时更新。\n- 场景.阶段：场景目标或处境发生明确变化时更新。\n- 角色.心情：依据角色在本轮的具体经历更新，使用简短自然语言。\n- 角色.信任：范围 0 至 100。明确的守信、帮助或伤害才影响该值；普通寒暄不改变。一次事件只计一次。\n更新使用状态中现有路径，不增加未定义字段。没有变化时输出空数组。\n",
            "constant": true,
            "selective": true,
            "enabled": true,
            "insertion_order": 102,
            "position": "before_char",
            "use_regex": false,
            "extensions": {
              "position": 4,
              "depth": 0,
              "role": 0,
              "probability": 100,
              "useProbability": true,
              "exclude_recursion": true,
              "prevent_recursion": true,
              "display_index": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "keys": [],
            "secondary_keys": [],
            "comment": "[mvu_update]变量输出格式",
            "content": "在叙事正文结束后追加变量更新块，格式如下：\n<UpdateVariable>\n<JSONPatch>\n[{\"op\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"/角色/心情\",\"value\":\"放松\"}]\n</JSONPatch>\n</UpdateVariable>\n这是格式示例，不代表实际发生了情绪变化。实际输出仅列出本轮应当变化的字段；没有变化则使用 []。\n路径以 / 分隔；字段名里的 ~ 和 / 分别写成 ~0 和 ~1。此卡已有字段使用 replace 更新。\n",
            "constant": true,
            "selective": true,
            "enabled": true,
            "insertion_order": 103,
            "position": "before_char",
            "use_regex": false,
            "extensions": {
              "position": 4,
              "depth": 0,
              "role": 0,
              "probability": 100,
              "useProbability": true,
              "exclude_recursion": true,
              "prevent_recursion": true,
              "display_index": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "keys": [],
            "secondary_keys": [],
            "comment": "状态栏输出位置",
            "content": "每次叙事正文结束后另起一行输出 <CardStatus/>，作为界面显示位置；若有变量更新块，将它放在变量更新块之前。",
            "constant": true,
            "selective": true,
            "enabled": true,
            "insertion_order": 104,
            "position": "before_char",
            "use_regex": false,
            "extensions": {
              "position": 0,
              "depth": 4,
              "role": 0,
              "probability": 100,
              "useProbability": true,
              "exclude_recursion": true,
              "prevent_recursion": true,
              "display_index": 4
            }
          }
        ]
      }
